# Internal planning and handover notes. These must never be served publicly:
# several of them contain local filesystem paths with a username and employer
# name. Mirrors the strip step in .github/workflows/deploy.yml, which only
# applies when deploying through GitHub Pages.
README.md
DEPLOY.md
GO-LIVE.md
FINAL-GO-LIVE.md
PROJECT_AUDIT.md
WHAT-CHANGED.md

# Unused on the site (the site uses an initials avatar, not this photo).
Hardik Profile PIC.png

# Vercel does not need repository or CI metadata to serve the site.
.git
.github
.gitignore
.nojekyll

# Tailwind build inputs. tailwind.css is generated and COMMITTED, so hosting
# needs no install or build step - it just serves the static output.
# Delete these lines only if you configure a build command on Vercel.
node_modules
src
package.json
package-lock.json
tailwind.config.js

# OG/social-image generator and its font cache. The generated images and the
# static per-entry pages ARE published (images/og/ and project-*.html /
# blog-*.html at the repo root) - only the tooling that creates them is not.
scripts
.og-cache